symbol ldo-sot23-5

description 5-pin LDO regulator in SOT-23-5
tags ldo regulator
# Placement rules: 1/3 on the left, 4/5 on the right, 2 on the bottom; pin connection points sit 2.5 outside the body edge.
# Same-side pins follow natural pin-number order: left side bottom to top 1, 3; right side bottom to top 4, 5.
# Body width is 13 mm to leave 6.5 mm clearance for pin names on each side.
# Pin connection points sit on the 0.5 mm placement lattice (ADR-0074) in both coordinates; rows are 2.5 mm apart (ADR-0058).
